  "body": "## Problem\n\n`crates/kernel/tests/machining_mesh_shortfalls.rs` gives one crafted provocation for each `PlanStats` shortfall of solidcore-tess. Case 3 adds a self-crossing inner loop on face 0 of `box.step`. Up to solidcore rev `2016386` this case gave `MeshRefusal::Lenient { face: 0, .. }`.\n\nSince solidcore rev `fa67b3f5` (#3767), the same case gives `Err(NotWatertight { open: 6, over: 0, turned: 0 })`. The mesh is still refused. But now no test reaches the `Lenient` arm of `judge` in `crates/kernel/src/machining_mesh.rs`.\n\nFound while working #3767.\n\n## Done means\n\n- A crafted case in `machining_mesh_shortfalls.rs` gives `MeshRefusal::Lenient` again at the current solidcore rev.\n- Or a decision in `docs/decisions/` records that solidcore-tess no longer reports a lenient fill, and the `Lenient` arm is removed.\n",
